  "reasoning": "The defendant sold a health supplement that was found to contain the prescription drug sildenafil (西地那非), which is not approved for over‑the‑counter sale. This constitutes the illegal sale of a drug that is effectively a counterfeit or unapproved medicinal product. Under Chinese criminal law, such conduct falls under the offense of illegal production and/or sale of counterfeit drugs. The facts show only the sale, but the statutory offense covers both production and sale, so the appropriate charge is illegal production and sale of counterfeit drugs.",
  "final_answer": "[罪名]非法生产、销售假药<eoa>"
